{"4551040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Animal Company", "steam_appid": 4551040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Offer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BONUS:</strong> All Steam players receive 5000 Company Coins ($20 value!) and an exclusive Valve Hat cosmetic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551040/extras/177f1acab569c8f50440ab93b626fb96.avif?t=1787774403\" alt=\"Bonus: Valve Hat + 5000 Company Coins\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animal Company is a chaotic multiplayer VR adventure where you and your friends play as thick-cheeked animals to explore haunted worlds, fight monsters, uncover secret lab experiments, and turn literal trash into powerful  gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every update is unpredictable with new procedural maps, quests, and physics items you can break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551040/extras/abfbad9f5dc9f19072824d34cb78a673.poster.avif?t=1787774403\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551040/extras/abfbad9f5dc9f19072824d34cb78a673.webm?t=1787774403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551040/extras/abfbad9f5dc9f19072824d34cb78a673.mp4?t=1787774403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔫 <strong>SURVIVE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into spooky forests, abandoned mines, low-gravity nuclear zones, lava caves to discover secret experiments from the mysterious Canopy Group.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid landmines to survive.<br>And maybe don’t trust your friends when they’re holding a grenade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551040/extras/b47fb6a36850c05ae96642e3102495b3.poster.avif?t=1787774403\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551040/extras/b47fb6a36850c05ae96642e3102495b3.webm?t=1787774403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551040/extras/b47fb6a36850c05ae96642e3102495b3.mp4?t=1787774403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛝 <strong>BUILD ANYTHING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trash matters. Everything you find can be used to craft weapons, mechs, vehicles, drones, toys. Our lobby is a social physics playground where you can goof  with friends all day long, in virtual reality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551040/extras/8039fb567da33af1863950a8c857b6ae.poster.avif?t=1787774403\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551040/extras/8039fb567da33af1863950a8c857b6ae.webm?t=1787774403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551040/extras/8039fb567da33af1863950a8c857b6ae.mp4?t=1787774403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😎 <strong>DRIP YOUR CHARACTER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own animal avatar with unique body parts and drippy fashion. Be whatever you want, even a walking flashlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551040/extras/1f03a14fb3631158235d9a5b7e5deb30.poster.avif?t=1787774403\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551040/extras/1f03a14fb3631158235d9a5b7e5deb30.webm?t=1787774403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551040/extras/1f03a14fb3631158235d9a5b7e5deb30.mp4?t=1787774403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📸 <strong>MEME-ABLE CLIPS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walkie-talkies and unpredictable events turn every adventure into a meme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scream, laugh, cry while you're getting chased by monsters or reviving a friend. You can host your own mini games &amp; even direct a film series inside this game too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551040/extras/2de5549034128be6446049bff9ead9c0.poster.avif?t=1787774403\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551040/extras/2de5549034128be6446049bff9ead9c0.webm?t=1787774403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551040/extras/2de5549034128be6446049bff9ead9c0.mp4?t=1787774403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👉 <strong>ACTIVE</strong> <strong>COMMUNITY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join one of the largest and most active social VR communities of 400K+ members on Discord with weekly contests, a creator program, and developer AMAs. The developers also love spooking you in the game, so be ready for random guest appearances when you play.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animal Company is a chaotic multiplayer VR adventure where you and your friends play as thick-cheeked animals to explore haunted worlds, fight monsters, uncover secret lab experiments, and turn literal trash into powerful  gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every update is unpredictable with new procedural maps, quests, and physics items you can break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551040/extras/abfbad9f5dc9f19072824d34cb78a673.poster.avif?t=1787774403\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551040/extras/abfbad9f5dc9f19072824d34cb78a673.webm?t=1787774403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551040/extras/abfbad9f5dc9f19072824d34cb78a673.mp4?t=1787774403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔫 <strong>SURVIVE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into spooky forests, abandoned mines, low-gravity nuclear zones, lava caves to discover secret experiments from the mysterious Canopy Group.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid landmines to survive.<br>And maybe don’t trust your friends when they’re holding a grenade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551040/extras/b47fb6a36850c05ae96642e3102495b3.poster.avif?t=1787774403\" aria-hidden=\"true